# Docker Build Configuration Example
# Docker 构建配置示例
#
# This file shows how to configure API keys when building the Docker image
# 此文件展示在构建 Docker 镜像时如何配置 API Key

# ============================================
# AI API Configuration (Build-time)
# AI API 配置（构建时）
# ============================================
# IMPORTANT: These are build-time variables for frontend (Vite)
# 重要提示：这些是前端（Vite）的构建时变量
# They will be baked into the built JavaScript bundle
# 它们会被打包到构建的 JavaScript bundle 中

# AI Provider (Optional / 可选)
# Options: deepseek | glm
# Default: deepseek
AI_PROVIDER=deepseek

# API Key (Required / 必需)
# DeepSeek: Get from https://platform.deepseek.com/
# GLM: Get from https://open.bigmodel.cn/
AI_API_KEY=your_api_key_here

# Base URL for API (Optional / 可选)
# Leave empty to use provider default
# 留空以使用提供商默认值
# DeepSeek default: https://api.deepseek.com
# GLM default: https://open.bigmodel.cn/api/paas/v4/
AI_BASE_URL=

# Model Name (Optional / 可选)
# Leave empty to use provider default
# 留空以使用提供商默认值
# DeepSeek default: deepseek-chat
# GLM default: glm-4-flash
AI_MODEL=

# ============================================
# Recommended Alternative: Runtime Configuration
# 推荐的替代方案：运行时配置
# ============================================
#
# Instead of baking API keys into the image, use runtime configuration:
# 与其将 API Key 打包到镜像中，不如使用运行时配置：
#
# 1. Copy runtime-config.example.json to runtime-config.json
#    cp runtime-config.example.json runtime-config.json
#
# 2. Edit runtime-config.json with your API credentials
#    编辑 runtime-config.json 填入你的 API 凭证
#
# 3. Mount it via docker-compose:
#    通过 docker-compose 挂载：
#    volumes:
#      - ./runtime-config.json:/config/runtime-config.json:ro
#
# Benefits / 优点：
# - No need to rebuild image when changing keys
#   更改密钥时无需重新构建镜像
# - More secure for production deployments
#   生产部署更安全
# - Easier to manage multiple environments
#   更容易管理多个环境
#
# See RUNTIME_CONFIG.md for details
# 详细说明见 RUNTIME_CONFIG.md

# ============================================
# Usage / 使用方法
# ============================================
#
# Method 1: Build with docker build (方法一：使用 docker build)
# ------------------------------------------------------------
# docker build \
#   --build-arg AI_PROVIDER="deepseek" \
#   --build-arg AI_API_KEY="your_key" \
#   --build-arg AI_BASE_URL="https://api.deepseek.com" \
#   --build-arg AI_MODEL="deepseek-chat" \
#   -t k-life:latest \
#   -f Dockerfile .
#
# Method 2: Build with docker-compose (方法二：使用 docker-compose)
# ------------------------------------------------------------
# Uncomment and edit the 'build' section in docker-compose.yml:
# 取消注释并编辑 docker-compose.yml 中的 'build' 部分：
#
# build:
#   context: .
#   dockerfile: Dockerfile
#   args:
#     AI_PROVIDER: "deepseek"
#     AI_API_KEY: "your_key"
#     AI_BASE_URL: "https://api.deepseek.com"
#     AI_MODEL: "deepseek-chat"
#
# Then run: 然后运行：
# docker-compose build
# docker-compose up -d
#
# Method 3: Use build script (方法三：使用构建脚本)
# ------------------------------------------------------------
# Edit build-and-push.sh and set the variables at the top:
# 编辑 build-and-push.sh 并在顶部设置变量：
#
# AI_PROVIDER="deepseek"
# AI_API_KEY="your_key"
# AI_BASE_URL=""
# AI_MODEL=""
#
# Then run: 然后运行：
# ./build-and-push.sh
#
# ============================================
# Security Notes / 安全提示
# ============================================
#
# ⚠️ WARNING: API keys will be embedded in the Docker image
# 警告：API Key 会被嵌入到 Docker 镜像中
#
# 1. Do NOT commit images with API keys to public repositories
#    不要将包含 API Key 的镜像提交到公共仓库
#
# 2. Use Docker's .dockerignore to prevent .env files from being copied
#    使用 Docker 的 .dockerignore 防止 .env 文件被复制
#
# 3. Consider using runtime configuration instead (see above)
#    考虑改用运行时配置（见上文）
#
# 4. For production, consider using secret management (Docker Secrets, Vault, etc.)
#    生产环境考虑使用密钥管理（Docker Secrets、Vault 等）
